      "Over a frantic five-minute breakfast of chai and toast, Abdul laid out what he had gathered through his business network. The bride’s family was well-established and highly respected in their circle. The father was a prominent, traditional gentleman. And there were two daughters: the elder, Naba, and a younger sister named Sara.",
      "Ten minutes later, the family piled into the car.",
